  "description": "Solitaire Legends – Card Masters brings traditional Klondike Solitaire into a modern framework with progression, customization, and long-term rewards.\nPlay classic Solitaire in 1-card or 3-card draw mode, choosing between a relaxed experience or a more challenging variant. Every completed game rewards you with score and experience, based on your efficiency, moves, and overall performance.\nAs you gain experience, you level up and unlock cosmetic rewards. These include card skins, background themes, and card back designs. Each individual card has multiple skins and can be customized separately, allowing you to build a deck that feels truly personal.\nBefore each match, you can freely adjust your visual setup. Whether you prefer a clean, classic look or something more colorful and modern, your Solitaire table adapts to your style.\nWith no time pressure and a steady sense of progression, Card Masters offers hours of relaxing gameplay and a constantly expanding collection of unlockable designs.",
